{
    "title": "Simple Alarm Clock",
    "description": "Simple Alarm is the best alarm clock in the Play Store, with the easiest alarm setting method, completely customizable, and extremely loud!\r\n\r\nSimple Alarm makes it easy to set your alarms in seconds. You can use it to wake up in the morning or setup reminders for your tasks during the day.\r\n\r\nWith Simple Alarm you can type in the time for an alarm directly on a numeric keyboard instead of pressing arrows or scrolling through a large list of numbers.\r\n\r\nUnlike other alarm clocks for Android, Simple Alarm sorts your alarms in the order they will sound next, so you can easily know what's coming next.\r\n\r\nIf you use Simple Alarm Clock to wake up in the morning, you will be able to wake up gently from your dreams, in a peaceful and progressive way, with our volume fade in feature (optional). This way, you can avoid being startled with a loud sound while you are in a deep sleep.\r\n\r\nSimple Alarm has a 3-button deactivation method (optional) that prevents you from accidentally turning off the alarm and oversleeping. You will need to be really awake to press all 3 buttons. \r\n\r\nIf you want to keep sleeping for a while, you can also snooze the alarm by pressing just one big Snooze button. Simple Alarm Clock lets you customize you alarm tone (selecting any ringtone, sound or song from your phone), the snooze duration between alarms, and many other settings.\r\n\r\nIf you want to wake up at the same time every day, on work days, weekends or just a few days a week, you can easily select which days you need when creating the alarm, and the alarm clock will go off on those selected days every week.\r\n\r\nSimple Alarm Clock Features:\r\n\u25cf Fastest setup method.\r\n\u25cf Super loud! (professionally mastered and normalized default sound, override phone volume feature)\r\n\u25cf Alarm enabling/disabling with one touch.\r\n\u25cf Set a message for each alarm.\r\n\u25cf AM/PM or 24 hours format.\r\n\u25cf Alarms sorted in the order they will ring.\r\n\u25cf Repeat alarms every week on certain days.\r\n\u25cf Smart alarm suggestions based on your previous alarms so you never forget to go to work or school.\r\n\u25cf Select the alarm sound you want from all your phone's ringtones, songs and sounds. Wake up to your favorite music!\r\n\u25cf Customize Snooze duration.\r\n\u25cf 3 buttons alarm de-activation to avoid turning alarm off and continue sleeping (optional).\r\n\u25cf 1 button alarm Snooze.\r\n\u25cf Wake up gently while volume and vibration increases slowly (optional).\r\n\u25cf The alarm gets extremely loud after some time to help heavy sleepers wake up too. Our default sound has been optimized to be the loudest it can be.\r\n\u25cf Available in English, Spanish, French, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Italian, Japanese, German, Korean, Arab, Hindi, Chinese, Indonesian and more.\r\n\u25cf Optimized for tablets and large screen devices too.\r\n\u25cf It's free!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Simple Alarm is the best alarm clock in the Play Store, with the easiest alarm setting method, completely customizable, and extremely loud!<br><br>Simple Alarm makes it easy to set your alarms in seconds. You can use it to wake up in the morning or setup reminders for your tasks during the day.<br><br>With Simple Alarm you can type in the time for an alarm directly on a numeric keyboard instead of pressing arrows or scrolling through a large list of numbers.<br><br>Unlike other alarm clocks for Android, Simple Alarm sorts your alarms in the order they will sound next, so you can easily know what&#39;s coming next.<br><br>If you use Simple Alarm Clock to wake up in the morning, you will be able to wake up gently from your dreams, in a peaceful and progressive way, with our volume fade in feature (optional). This way, you can avoid being startled with a loud sound while you are in a deep sleep.<br><br>Simple Alarm has a 3-button deactivation method (optional) that prevents you from accidentally turning off the alarm and oversleeping. You will need to be really awake to press all 3 buttons. <br><br>If you want to keep sleeping for a while, you can also snooze the alarm by pressing just one big Snooze button. Simple Alarm Clock lets you customize you alarm tone (selecting any ringtone, sound or song from your phone), the snooze duration between alarms, and many other settings.<br><br>If you want to wake up at the same time every day, on work days, weekends or just a few days a week, you can easily select which days you need when creating the alarm, and the alarm clock will go off on those selected days every week.<br><br>Simple Alarm Clock Features:<br>\u25cf Fastest setup method.<br>\u25cf Super loud! (professionally mastered and normalized default sound, override phone volume feature)<br>\u25cf Alarm enabling/disabling with one touch.<br>\u25cf Set a message for each alarm.<br>\u25cf AM/PM or 24 hours format.<br>\u25cf Alarms sorted in the order they will ring.<br>\u25cf Repeat alarms every week on certain days.<br>\u25cf Smart alarm suggestions based on your previous alarms so you never forget to go to work or school.<br>\u25cf Select the alarm sound you want from all your phone&#39;s ringtones, songs and sounds. Wake up to your favorite music!<br>\u25cf Customize Snooze duration.<br>\u25cf 3 buttons alarm de-activation to avoid turning alarm off and continue sleeping (optional).<br>\u25cf 1 button alarm Snooze.<br>\u25cf Wake up gently while volume and vibration increases slowly (optional).<br>\u25cf The alarm gets extremely loud after some time to help heavy sleepers wake up too. Our default sound has been optimized to be the loudest it can be.<br>\u25cf Available in English, Spanish, French, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Italian, Japanese, German, Korean, Arab, Hindi, Chinese, Indonesian and more.<br>\u25cf Optimized for tablets and large screen devices too.<br>\u25cf It&#39;s free!",
